Fonts: packages/cloudscape_flutter/assets/fonts/open_sans/ contains the
Open Sans faces bundled by @cloudscape-design/global-styles 1.0.72, decoded
from WOFF2 to TTF. Upstream labels them "Open Sans Fonts | Apache License,
Version 2.0".

Theming: packages/cloudscape_tokens/lib/src/{theming,palette}.dart port the
logic of @cloudscape-design/theming-runtime 1.0.139 (Apache-2.0).

i18n: packages/cloudscape_flutter/lib/i18n/messages/ and
packages/cloudscape_flutter/l10n/ are generated from the message bundles of
@cloudscape-design/components (Apache-2.0); lib/src/i18n/ ports the
I18nProvider / I18nFormatter logic.

CLDR: tool/upstream/cldr/ (and the generated
packages/cloudscape_flutter/lib/src/i18n/generated/plural_rules.g.dart)
contain plural rule data from cldr-core 47.0.0, Copyright © 1991-2025
Unicode, Inc., licensed under the Unicode License v3 (Unicode-3.0).
Also from CLDR 47.0.0 (Unicode-3.0): tool/upstream/cldr/dates/ (cldr-dates-full,
cldr-cal-buddhist-full), tool/upstream/cldr/numbers-summary.json (derived from
cldr-numbers-full) and tool/upstream/cldr/supplemental/, plus the generated
packages/cloudscape_flutter/lib/src/i18n/generated/cldr_data.g.dart.
